 structures from Point Defense Cannons, to Drone Hubs, to experimental gravity manipulators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Technology System: </strong>Unlock new capabilities through research, permanently improving your base and abilities for future deployments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Mystery: </strong>Piece together the disturbing history of Atlas Station through discovered logs, environmental storytelling, and cryptic messages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Resource Management: B</strong>alance immediate survival needs against long-term goals in a hostile environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Progression Paths: </strong>Prioritize drones, first-person mode, towers, or other strategies based on your playstyle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Company thanks you for your service. Your deployment begins now. Remember - efficiency is expected, survival is optional.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN ACTIVE DEVELOPMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Atlas Problem is evolving rapidly with regular updates driven by our passionate community. Join our Discord to participate in testing, share feedback, and help shape the future of Atlas Station!</p>", "short_description": "Defend Atlas Station from waves of asteroid bombardment. Build towers, shoot and survive in first-person, collect resources from destroyed debris, then upgrade your defenses and the station itself. Die and try again with permanent upgrades in this roguelike tower defense game.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064620/1ab25ef6c52b35062c7ec1b7e3a7b159147a8b70/header.jpg?t=1770004893", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets